<title>BELGIUM: GENERALE BANK MODIFIES BASE LENDING RATES.</title>
<headline>GENERALE BANK MODIFIES BASE LENDING RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Generale Bank </p>
<p>said on Wednesday it would modify base lending rates from Friday</p>
<p>February 21.</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    one year	  4.80 pct	4.75 pct</p>
<p>    three years     5.40 pct	5.45 pct</p>
<p>    five years	6.10 pct	6.30 pct</p>
<p>    seven years     6.65 pct	6.90 pct</p>
<p>    10 years	  7.15 pct	7.45 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - the changes reflect the evolution of market rates.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
